      {
        "annotationBody": "field_gen publishes an RGBA16F height field → contour_blue / contour_accent / grid_warp / node_gen all derive from it. node_gen → link_gen + label_gen (structured-buffer data lanes) → renderers. atmosphere + frame_hud (porthole + viewport mask). compositor stacks all layers → post (bloom/vignette/teal grade). signal drives node pulse / field warp / accent beat / ring spin via expressions.",
        "annotationColor": "#0a2a3aff",
        "annotationTitle": "TOPOGRAPHIC HUD — modular scene",
        "displayName": "TOPOGRAPHIC HUD — modular scene",
        "entityId": "annotation_16",
